cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "CPMs: Context-Based Proposition Maps for Model Checking Learned Automata"
abstract: >-
  Annotates learned Mealy machines (DOT format) with security-relevant
  propositions using context-based proposition maps (CPMs) and translates
  them into Rebeca models and property files for model checking.
